", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 19732401, "full_name": "Timothy McGinn", "first_name": "Timothy", "last_name": "McGinn", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 19732404, "full_name": "Miriam-Rose Menezes", "first_name": "Miriam-Rose", "last_name": "Menezes", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 15115729, "full_name": "Lavoisier Ramos-Espiritu", "first_name": "Lavoisier", "last_name": "Ramos-Espiritu", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 19732407, "full_name": "Priyam Banerjee", "first_name": "Priyam", "last_name": "Banerjee", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10579216, "full_name": "John T. Poirier", "first_name": "John T.", "last_name": "Poirier", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 19732410, "full_name": "Francisco J. S\u00e0nchez-Rivera", "first_name": "Francisco J.", "last_name": "S\u00e0nchez-Rivera", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 2160433, "full_name": "Aur\u00e9lie Cobat", "first_name": "Aur\u00e9lie", "last_name": "Cobat", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 49333, "full_name": "Qian Zhang", "first_name": "Qian", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Qian_Zhang", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 64712, "full_name": "Jean-Laurent Casanova", "first_name": "Jean-Laurent", "last_name": "Casanova", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Jean_Laurent_Casanova", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 6943151, "full_name": "Thomas S. Carroll", "first_name": "Thomas S.", "last_name": "Carroll", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 2329612, "full_name": "J. Fraser Glickman", "first_name": "J. Fraser", "last_name": "Glickman", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 233192, "full_name": "Eleftherios Michailidis", "first_name": "Eleftherios", "last_name": "Michailidis", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 19732413, "full_name": "Brandon Razooky", "first_name": "Brandon", "last_name": "Razooky", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9444081, "full_name": "Margaret R. MacDonald", "first_name": "Margaret R.", "last_name": "MacDonald", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9110743, "full_name": "Charles M. Rice", "first_name": "Charles M.", "last_name": "Rice", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/PLSCR1_p_His262Tyr_which_associates_with_severe_COVID-19_leads_to_higher_SARS-CoV-2_infection_in_cell_culture_/27097614", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(<b>A</b>) Protein diagram of PLSCR1. Domain coordinates from UniProt [<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3002767#pbio.3002767.ref197\" target=\"_blank\">197</a>]. (<b>B</b>) CADD MAF plot showing the common variants of the <i>PLSCR1</i> gene reported in gnomAD [<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3002767#pbio.3002767.ref132\" target=\"_blank\">132</a>,<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3002767#pbio.3002767.ref133\" target=\"_blank\">133</a>]. The plot displays the CADD scores, indicating the predicted deleteriousness of each variant, against the MAF. (<b>C</b>) A549-ACE2 PLSCR1 KO cells were transduced to stably and ectopically express the indicated PLSCR1 variants. The cells were then infected for 24 hours with SARS-CoV-2. SARS-CoV-2 N was stained by IF and the percentage of positive cells determined by imaging. <i>n</i> = 4 separate wells infected on the same day. Error bars represent SD; **, <i>p</i> \u2264 0.01; ****, <i>p</i> < 0.0001; one-way ANOVA. (<b>D</b>) A549-ACE2 cells, WT and PLSCR1 KO, stably expressing N-terminal FLAG-tagged Fluc, N-terminal FLAG-tagged PLSCR1, or N-terminal FLAG-tagged PLSCR1 H262Y mutant and infected with SARS-CoV-2 for 24 hours. SARS-CoV-2 N was stained by IF and the percentage of positive cells determined by imaging. <i>n</i> = 15 separate wells infected on the same day. Error bars represent SD; ****, <i>p</i> \u2264 0.0001; two-tailed <i>t</i> test. (<b>E</b>) SV40-Fibroblast-ACE2 cells, genotype as indicated, infected for 24 hours with SARS-CoV-2. <i>n</i> = 8 separate wells infected on the same day. ns, nonsignificant; *, <i>p</i> \u2264 0.05; **, <i>p</i> \u2264 0.01; ****, <i>p</i> \u2264 0.0001; one-way ANOVA. The data underlying this Figure can be found in <b><a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3002767#pbio.3002767.s015\" target=\"_blank\">S1 Table</a></b>. ACE2, angiotensin converting enzyme 2; CADD, Combined Annotation Dependent Depletion; COVID-19, Coronavirus Disease 2019; Fluc, Firefly Luciferase; Fs, frameshift; IF, immunofluorescence; KO, knockout; MAF, minor allele frequency; PLSCR1, phospholipid scramblase 1; SARS-CoV-2, Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome Coronavirus 2; WT, wild type.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 638896, "created_date": "2024-09-24T17:41:06Z", "modified_date": "2024-10-17T17:45:34Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["coronavirus disease 2019", "identify human genes", "identified 28 genes", "human genetic studies", "functional genetic screens", "endocytic entry route", "div >< p", "plscr1 primarily restricts", "recent virus variants", "require ifn induction", "plscr1 variants present", "resist </ p", "plscr1 </", "genes interacting", "scale studies", "functional effects", "2 variants", "recent sars", "2 entry", "tmprss2 overexpression", "stimulated gene", "mediated restriction", "many related", "intrinsic barrier", "integrated analysis", "ifn signaling", "ifn pathway", "high relevance", "crucial